    "title": {
      "en": "How to Reserve Your World of Warcraft: Forever Character Name on October 27th",
      "es": "Cómo reservar tu nombre de personaje de World of Warcraft: Forever el 27 de octubre"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "How to Reserve Your World of Warcraft: Forever Character Name on October 27th...",
      "es": "Cómo reservar tu nombre de personaje de World of Warcraft: Forever el 27 de octubre..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad8c9de341671.82685049\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has revealed how players can reserve their character names in World of Warcraft: Forever on October 27th!<br><br>Starting on <b>October 27th at 1:00 PM PDT</b>, eligible players can create and reserve up to three characters across all the Rulesets!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-gb/news/24303866\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Early Name Reservations for <i>World of Warcraft: Forever</i> are available from 27 October through 3 November, giving players an opportunity to secure the names that will become part of their adventures in Azeroth.<hr><h2 id=\"name-reservation-start-times\" class=\"heading-size-2\">Name Reservation Start Times</h2><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Europe:</b>&nbsp;27 October at 18:00 CET</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>North America:</b>&nbsp;27 October at 13:00 PDT</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Korea:</b>&nbsp;28 October at 07:00 KST</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><b>Taiwan:</b>&nbsp;28 October at 07:00 CST</div></li></ul>During the reservation period, eligible players* can create and reserve names for up to three characters total across all Rulesets. This means that if you create two on a PvP Ruleset, you’ll only be able to create one more character in a Normal or Role-Play Ruleset. This restriction only applies to Early Name Reservation.<h3 id=\"prepare-to-launch\" class=\"heading-size-3\">Prepare to Launch</h3><ol class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Make sure your graphics drivers are up to date.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Download and install the <a href=\"https://download.battle.net/desktop\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Battle.net desktop app</a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Open the Battle.net desktop app and allow it to update if needed.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Select <i>World of Warcraft</i> from the list of games.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">In the Game Version menu above the Play button, select <i>World of Warcraft: Forever</i>, then select Install.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Once installation is complete select Play and <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24302070/\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">choose your Ruleset</a>.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Create up to 3 characters with your chosen name.</div></li></ol>Choose the names that will carry your heroes into a new age and prepare for your adventures in World of Warcraft: Forever.<hr>Players who <a href=\"https://us.shop.battle.net/en-us/product/world-of-warcraft-forever?_gl=1*d7m9ad*\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">pre-purchase</a> the Skyborne Heroic Pack, Skyborne Epic Pack, or limited-time Warcraft Forever Collection will have access to <i>WoW</i>®: Forever Early Name Reservation from 27 October through 3 November. Character names will be available on a first-come, first-served basis, and desired names cannot be guaranteed.<br><br>For additional information on how character names work, check out the previously published <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24304161\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Create a Name of Your Own in WoW: Forever</a> article.<br><br><i>* Purchase of World of Warcraft: Forever Digital Upgrade or Collector’s Edition required. This benefit only applies to the specific WoW<sup>®</sup> account it was purchased for. WoW<sup>®</sup>: Forever Early Name Reservation will be available starting October 27 through November 3. Character names are limited to a first-come, first-serve basis, and desired names cannot be guaranteed.</i></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has revealed how players can reserve their character names in World of Warcraft: Forever on October 27th!<br /><br />Starting on <b>October 27th at 1:00 PM PDT</b>, eligible players can create and reserve up to three characters across all the Rulesets!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Early Name Reservations for <i>World of Warcraft: Forever</i> are available from 27 October through 3 November, giving players an opportunity to secure the names that will become part of their adventures in Azeroth.<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"> Name Reservation Start Times </h2><br /><ul><li><b>Europe:</b>&nbsp;27 October at 18:00 CET</li><li><b>North America:</b>&nbsp;27 October at 13:00 PDT</li><li><b>Korea:</b>&nbsp;28 October at 07:00 KST</li><li><b>Taiwan:</b>&nbsp;28 October at 07:00 CST</li></ul><br />During the reservation period, eligible players* can create and reserve names for up to three characters total across all Rulesets. This means that if you create two on a PvP Ruleset, you’ll only be able to create one more character in a Normal or Role-Play Ruleset. This restriction only applies to Early Name Reservation.<br /><br /><h3 class=\"heading-size-3\"> Prepare to Launch </h3><br /><ol><li>Make sure your graphics drivers are up to date.</li><li>Download and install the <a href=\"https://download.battle.net/desktop\" rel=\"nofollow\">Battle.net desktop app</a></li><li>Open the Battle.net desktop app and allow it to update if needed.</li><li>Select <i>World of Warcraft</i> from the list of games.</li><li>In the Game Version menu above the Play button, select <i>World of Warcraft: Forever</i>, then select Install.</li><li>Once installation is complete select Play and <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24302070/\" rel=\"nofollow\">choose your Ruleset</a>.</li><li>Create up to 3 characters with your chosen name.</li></ol><br />Choose the names that will carry your heroes into a new age and prepare for your adventures in World of Warcraft: Forever.<br /><br />Players who <a href=\"https://us.shop.battle.net/en-us/product/world-of-warcraft-forever?_gl=1*d7m9ad*\" rel=\"nofollow\">pre-purchase</a> the Skyborne Heroic Pack, Skyborne Epic Pack, or limited-time Warcraft Forever Collection will have access to <i>WoW</i>®: Forever Early Name Reservation from 27 October through 3 November. Character names will be available on a first-come, first-served basis, and desired names cannot be guaranteed.<br /><br />For additional information on how character names work, check out the previously published <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24304161\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create a Name of Your Own in WoW: Forever</a> article.<br /><br /><i>* Purchase of World of Warcraft: Forever Digital Upgrade or Collector’s Edition required. This benefit only applies to the specific WoW® account it was purchased for. WoW®: Forever Early Name Reservation will be available starting October 27 through November 3. Character names are limited to a first-come, first-serve basis, and desired names cannot be guaranteed.</i></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
