    "title": {
      "en": "Blizzard Announces Closing Date and Extension for WoW: Forever Beta",
      "es": "Blizzard anuncia la fecha de cierre y la extensión de la beta de WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Announces Closing Date and Extension for WoW: Forever Beta...",
      "es": "Blizzard anuncia la fecha de cierre y la extensión de WoW: Forever Beta..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad8c810ea7016.98430616\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The World of Warcraft: Forever Beta has been extended an extra two days and will be going offline on Friday, October 23rd. <br><br>The WoW: Forever Beta has entered its final week, with the original closing date of the Beta being <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Warcraft/posts/7-days-to-go-experience-all-of-wow-forever-up-to-level-30-until-the-beta-ends-on/1607883941376343/\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">October 21st</a>. In a new Blue Post, Blizzard has extended the WoW: Forever Beta an extra two days, and announced the new closing time of Friday, October 23rd at 10:00 AM Pacific time. <br><br>As the Forever Beta has now been extended past Thursday, it's possible that we get to see one more Beta build before the servers go down.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2387920/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We plan to close the WoW Forever Beta … forever at 10:00 a.m. PDT on Friday, October 23.<br><br>Thank you very much for joining us. We’ll see you there!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The World of Warcraft: Forever Beta has been extended an extra two days and will be going offline on Friday, October 23rd. <br /><br />The WoW: Forever Beta has entered its final week, with the original closing date of the Beta being <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Warcraft/posts/7-days-to-go-experience-all-of-wow-forever-up-to-level-30-until-the-beta-ends-on/1607883941376343/\" rel=\"nofollow\">October 21st</a>. In a new Blue Post, Blizzard has extended the WoW: Forever Beta an extra two days, and announced the new closing time of Friday, October 23rd at 10:00 AM Pacific time. <br /><br />As the Forever Beta has now been extended past Thursday, it's possible that we get to see one more Beta build before the servers go down. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br /><br />We plan to close the WoW Forever Beta … forever at 10:00 a.m. PDT on Friday, October 23.<br /><br />Thank you very much for joining us. We’ll see you there!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
